因縁因縁迷いし来いよ
Wandering spirits of fate, come here!

112
00:10:02,151 --> 00:10:05,031
せっかくの翼でいざなえ
Guide us with your precious wings!

113
00:10:07,151 --> 00:10:11,771
終われら エルルの星 宇宙を滑るもの 秘密結社
The ruling stars of Eruru, rulers of the cosmos, Secret Society...

114
00:10:11,991 --> 00:10:14,351
holoX!

115
